python binding for yupiter
==========================

A PyO3 binding of the public C17 interface.  Not part of the library
build; lives in python/ and is built with maturin.  Links against
libyupiter.so.  Same three licenses as the library.


Requirements
------------

Python 3.12+, Rust toolchain, maturin, patchelf.


Build
-----

    ./configure --enable-tests=no
    make
    cd python && maturin build --release --out dist
    pip install python/dist/yupiter-*.whl

For iterative development use maturin develop.


Exposed symbols
---------------

Output: printf, fprintf.
Memory: malloc, free, realloc.
Safe memory: malloc_safe, free_safe, realloc_safe, plus checked
variants.
Constants: YUPITER_HEAP_SIZE-related values as exposed.


Design notes
------------

Links against libyupiter.so, not the static archive: the archive
contains _start, which conflicts with the interpreter.  FFI uses
link_name for the C symbols.  Safe variants raise OverflowError,
